+# Security Fix: CVE-2026-111497
+
+**Package**: pyarrow 26.0.0
+**CVE**: CVE-2026-111497
+
+The Brotli decoder bundled by Apache Arrow C++ (v1.0.9) does not detect an
+invalid block-switch stream early enough. The fix builds the bundled Brotli
+from v1.2.1, which contains "Detect and report invalid stream earlier".
+
+The change lives in `cpp/cmake_modules/ThirdpartyToolchain.cmake`, which is not
+part of the PyPI sdist (no Arrow C++ source). It is applied during the native
+build from `build/CVE-2026-111497.patch` against the apache-arrow-26.0.0 tag.
